  "releaseNotes": "Version 4.5.0:\n              - Add Provider.EnableTraceLoggingFullSchemaHashing() to distinguish TraceLogging events that reuse a name with different fields. Call it before enabling the provider; hashing is disabled by default.\n              - Bound underlying TraceLogging event-name reads and validate metadata lengths, including metadata within larger extended-data buffers.\n              - Fix underlying schema-key copy assignment recursion and preserve owned event names, including assignments from borrowed names.",
